{"title":"2003 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At a school fundraiser, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/3/a13147e189038008e6edc0833e4b890f85b81078.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3109$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> was raised. The money was shared equally among <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> charities. The amount received by each charity from the school was\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/2899dde9b907c01a90f1d3e6fd5792b27891fa09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\$12.76 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$84.36 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$111.04 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$150.76 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$124.36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"622\" height=\"19\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since each charity got the same amount received, we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the money/amount received by each charity. Setting up an equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa2a1089b31759d2434c25c6e09a0403c242fa62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25r = \\$3109$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f00a082e58cb1c1b75dc9dcc9fe7e8c5f255e7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{\\$3109}{25} = \\frac{\\$3109 \\times 4}{25 \\times 4} = \\frac{\\$12436}{100} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } \\$124.36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"401\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2003 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2003 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\">